#: apps/absences/recovery.py:182
msgid "That recovery has already been decided."
msgstr "Esa recuperación ya se resolvió."

#: apps/absences/recovery.py:189
msgid "a holiday recovery"
msgstr "una recuperación de vacaciones"

#: apps/absences/services.py:308
msgid "Say what kind of leave it is."
msgstr "Di de qué tipo de ausencia se trata."

#: apps/absences/services.py:320
msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough, and since RD 1060/2022 the worker does not hand the "
"certificate to the employer."
msgstr ""
"El parte de baja no se almacena. Basta con registrar la ausencia, sus fechas "
"y su estado, y desde el RD 1060/2022 el trabajador no entrega el parte a la "
"empresa."

#: apps/absences/services.py:351
#, python-format
msgid "There is already leave recorded between %(from)s and %(to)s."
msgstr "Ya hay una ausencia registrada entre el %(from)s y el %(to)s."

#: apps/absences/services.py:371
msgid ""
"Say which suspension it is: they carry different articles and different "
"consequences, and the record has to name one."
msgstr ""
"Di qué suspensión es: llevan artículos y consecuencias distintas, y el "
"registro tiene que nombrar una."

#: apps/absences/services.py:380
msgid ""
"A reduction covers whole days at a smaller share. For hours away on one day, "
"leave the reduction empty."
msgstr ""
"Una reducción cubre días enteros a una jornada menor. Para horas sueltas de "
"un día, deja la reducción vacía."

#: apps/absences/services.py:389
msgid ""
"Only a suspension can reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr ""
"Solo una suspensión puede reducir la jornada. Para menos horas por acuerdo, "
"cambia las horas contratadas de la persona."

#: apps/absences/services.py:412
#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(kind)s» cannot reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr ""
"«%(kind)s» no puede reducir la jornada. Para menos horas por acuerdo, cambia "
"la jornada contratada de la persona."

#: apps/absences/services.py:422
msgid ""
"Holiday is taken in whole days. For part of a day, use the leave type that "
"fits: a medical appointment, family emergency, an exam."
msgstr ""
"Las vacaciones se cogen por días completos. Para parte de un día usa el "
"permiso que corresponda: visita médica, fuerza mayor familiar, un examen."

#: apps/absences/services.py:585 apps/absences/services.py:622
msgid "leave"
msgstr "una ausencia"

#: apps/absences/services.py:595
msgid "Leave has since been approved for those dates."
msgstr "Mientras tanto se ha aprobado otra ausencia para esas fechas."

#: apps/absences/services.py:655
msgid "That request belongs to somebody else."
msgstr "Esa solicitud es de otra persona."

#: apps/absences/uploads.py:72
#, python-format
msgid "Only a PDF or an image: %(allowed_extensions)s."
msgstr "Solo un PDF o una imagen: %(allowed_extensions)s."

#: apps/absences/uploads.py:98
#, python-format
msgid "The file does not look like a %(kind)s inside, whatever its name says."
msgstr "Por dentro el fichero no parece un %(kind)s, se llame como se llame."

#: apps/absences/uploads.py:106
#, python-format
msgid "The file is %(size).1f MB and the limit is %(limit)s MB."
msgstr "El fichero ocupa %(size).1f MB y el límite son %(limit)s MB."

