#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"An account has been created for you at %(company)s to record your working "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Se te ha creado una cuenta en %(company)s para registrar tu jornada."

#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Somebody asked to reset the password of your account at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Alguien ha pedido restablecer la contraseña de tu cuenta en %(company)s."

#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:8
msgid "Open this link to set your password:"
msgstr "Abre este enlace para establecer tu contraseña:"

#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The link works once and expires in %(hours)s hours.\n"
"\n"
"If it was not you, ignore this message: nothing changes until the link is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"El enlace sirve una sola vez y caduca en %(hours)s horas.\n"
"\n"
"Si no has sido tú, ignora este mensaje: no cambia nada hasta que se use el "
"enlace."

#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"You have a shift at %(company)s today and have not clocked in yet.\n"
"\n"
"Clock in when you can, so your working day is recorded at the real time."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Hoy tienes turno en %(company)s y todavía no has fichado la entrada.\n"
"\n"
"Ficha cuando puedas, para que tu jornada quede registrada a la hora real."

#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your working day of %(day)s at %(company)s is still open: you clocked in and "
"not out.\n"
"\n"
"Clock out when you finish. The server sets the time from your punch, so it "
"is\n"
"recorded exactly as it happens, overtime included if you stay longer today."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Tu jornada del %(day)s en %(company)s sigue abierta: fichaste la entrada y "
"no la salida.\n"
"\n"
"Ficha la salida cuando termines. El servidor pone la hora con tu fichaje, "
"así que queda registrada tal cual, incluidas las horas de más si hoy te "
"quedas más tiempo."

#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:12
msgid ""
"This is only a reminder: nothing has been recorded for you. You can turn "
"these off in your profile."
msgstr ""
"Esto es solo un recordatorio: no se ha registrado nada por ti. Puedes "
"desactivarlos en tu perfil."

#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your employer, %(company)s, proposes a change to your working time record."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Tu empresa, %(company)s, propone un cambio en tu registro de jornada."

#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reason given: %(reason)s\n"
"Proposed by: %(proposed_by)s"
msgstr ""
"Motivo indicado: %(reason)s\n"
"Lo propone: %(proposed_by)s"

#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Nothing has changed yet. You can accept it, or say you do not agree ---\n"
"in which case your account is recorded beside the change and the workers' "
"legal\n"
"representation is informed.\n"
"\n"
"You have %(days)s days to answer. After that the company may apply the "
"change,\n"
"and it will be recorded as made without your agreement."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no se ha cambiado nada. Puedes aceptarlo o decir que no estás de\n"
"acuerdo, y en ese caso tu versión queda registrada junto al cambio y se "
"informa\n"
"a la representación legal de las personas trabajadoras.\n"
"\n"
"Tienes %(days)s días para responder. Pasado ese plazo la empresa puede "
"aplicar\n"
"el cambio, y quedará anotado que se hizo sin tu conformidad."

#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your employer, %(company)s, has withdrawn the change it proposed to your\n"
"working time record."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Tu empresa, %(company)s, ha retirado el cambio que proponía en tu registro\n"
"de jornada."

#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:8
#, python-format
msgid "Withdrawn by: %(withdrawn_by)s"
msgstr "La ha retirado: %(withdrawn_by)s"

#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:9
#, python-format
msgid "Reason given: %(note)s"
msgstr "Motivo indicado: %(note)s"

#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:11
msgid ""
"Your record has not changed, and there is nothing for you to\n"
"answer any more. The entry stayed exactly as it was."
msgstr ""
"Tu registro no ha cambiado y ya no tienes que contestar nada. El asiento se "
"ha quedado exactamente como estaba."

#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your working time record has been changed at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Tu registro de jornada en %(company)s ha cambiado."

#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reason given: %(reason)s\n"
"Decided by: %(resolver)s on %(decided_on)s."
msgstr ""
"Motivo indicado: %(reason)s\n"
"Resuelto por: %(resolver)s el %(decided_on)s."

#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:10
msgid ""
"The previous version has not been deleted: both are kept in your\n"
"history, and you can download your full record at any time.\n"
"\n"
"If this does not match what happened, tell whoever manages your working time."
msgstr ""
"La versión anterior no se ha borrado: las dos quedan en tu\n"
"historial, y puedes descargar tu registro completo cuando quieras.\n"
"\n"
"Si esto no coincide con lo que pasó, díselo a quien gestione tu jornada."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Here is the link to download your own working time record at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Aquí tienes el enlace para descargar tu propio registro de jornada en "
"%(company)s."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It expires in %(hours)s hours, and until then you can use it as many\n"
"times as you need --- the PDF and the spreadsheet are two downloads. If it "
"stops\n"
"working, ask %(company)s for another one."
msgstr ""
"Caduca en %(hours)s horas y hasta entonces puedes usarlo las veces que\n"
"necesites: el PDF y la hoja de cálculo son dos descargas. Si deja de\n"
"funcionar, pídele otro a %(company)s."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:11
msgid ""
"What you get is the whole record still kept, which is at least the four\n"
"years the law requires. It does not open an account and it gives access to\n"
"nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Lo que recibes es todo el registro que aún se conserva, que son al menos\n"
"los cuatro años que exige la ley. No abre ninguna cuenta y no da acceso a\n"
"nada más."

#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"You are recorded as a workers' representative at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola:\n"
"\n"
"Constas como representante de las personas trabajadoras en %(company)s."

#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(employee)s disagrees with a change the company proposes to their\n"
"working time record, dated %(day)s."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s no está de acuerdo con un cambio que la empresa propone en su\n"
"registro de jornada, del %(day)s."

#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:8
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b of the working-time record decree requires that you be informed\n"
"when this happens. The company may still apply the change, and if it does, "
"the\n"
"record will show it was made without agreement, with their account beside "
"it.\n"
"\n"
"What they wrote is not reproduced here. Art. 6.2 grants you access to the\n"
"register, so you can consult the entry and its history in the application."
msgstr ""
"El artículo 4.b del decreto de registro de jornada exige que se te informe\n"
"cuando esto ocurre. La empresa puede aplicar el cambio de todas formas, y si "
"lo\n"
"hace, el registro dirá que se hizo sin acuerdo y llevará al lado lo que esa "
"persona\n"
"declaró.\n"
"\n"
"Aquí no se reproduce lo que escribió. El artículo 6.2 te da acceso al\n"
"registro, así que puedes consultar el asiento y su historial en la "
"aplicación."
